== --allow-net and the provisional n entries ==
-- the destination as a CIDR, the shape ticket 22 left: {"cidr":"0.0.0.0/0","ports":[443]} --
### --allow-net=0.0.0.0/0:443, hostname in the URL
$ deno run --no-prompt --allow-net=0.0.0.0/0:443 /home/pniroula/Projects/gvisor-t23/docs/snp/evidence/ticket23/spikes/E3/probe-net.ts https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc8446.txt
ERROR NotCapable: Requires net access to "www.rfc-editor.org:443", run again with the --allow-net flag
EXIT=0

### --allow-net=0.0.0.0/0, no port
$ deno run --no-prompt --allow-net=0.0.0.0/0 /home/pniroula/Projects/gvisor-t23/docs/snp/evidence/ticket23/spikes/E3/probe-net.ts https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc8446.txt
